This project is built on nfsu1-sw by antoxa2584x (Anton Artemov, https://github.com/antoxa2584x/nfsu1-sw): the static
recompilation of the game and its runtime, and on the Apple host and Metal renderer of nfsu2-ios by myUdav4iik
(https://github.com/myUdav4iik/nfsu2-ios). Their files keep their authorship. engine/ is nfsu1-sw's tree with the patches in
docs/upstream-patches/ applied, and this project's later changes are in its git history. Anyone reusing this project's code: keep
this credit, and the links to their projects, with it.

The Metal renderer's effects, pacing and resolution changes come from NFSU2Deadware by LeoDeadware
(https://github.com/LeoDeadware/NFSU2Deadware, MIT, LICENSES/MIT-NFSU2Deadware.txt), by way of the NFS Underground 2 port
(https://github.com/sanyokkua/nfsu2-xbox-port); the installer's kit builder, build and import scripts adapt its tools (MIT).
xboxrecomp by sp00nz is MIT (LICENSES/MIT-xboxrecomp.txt); its APU and NV2A parts from xemu are LGPL-2.1-or-later
(LICENSES/LGPL-2.1-xemu.txt, LICENSES/NOTICE-xboxrecomp.txt): the installer ships them as object files and links them on the
player's Mac, so they can be relinked with modified versions. The disc check follows reUndr-ps5's by bystritskiy (MIT). The
settings menu follows the design of SpeedBreaker's by project(u) (GPL-3.0-or-later) and draws with Dear ImGui (MIT,
LICENSES/MIT-imgui.txt) in Roboto Medium (Apache-2.0, LICENSES/Apache-2.0-Roboto.txt). Third-party libraries:
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

No game code or data is part of this project or its releases: the game is built on the player's Mac from their own disc.
